# Text files are stored and checked out with LF, whatever the contributor's OS.
# Added 2026-08-22 after a Windows tool silently rewrote four markdown files
# from LF to CRLF, turning a 16-line edit into a 1050-line diff twice running.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Captured device responses are kept byte-exact as they came off the wire.
# They are evidence, not source: never renormalise them.
research/captures/** -text

# Binary assets, so git never guesses.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
